  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TRANSLED (Transformation, Language, Education and Development)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at contributing to informed policy-making and better service delivery in the education sector, leading in time to an increased number of children completing good quality primary and secondary education in Tanzania. It is a collaboration between The State University of Zanzibar, University of Dar-es-Salaam and The University of Oslo.</narrative>
  </description>
